


 Minutes of the FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

Date: 07/12/90   Time: 22:32EDT
   
     The question of the night (in preperation for next weeks guest conference)
     'Have you used the SC32 or SBC32 ?'. Other items discussed include NASA,
     COSMIC,Kitts Peak VAX Forth,Johns-Hopkins,signed carry,+LOOP,LOOP,DIVIDE,
     inverted borrow,STICKY BIT,FOR/NEXT

