<[Robert] R.BERKEY> unsigned bit.
<[Robert] R.BERKEY> The original Hayes design I thought was that way.
<GARY-S> Obviously, I don't use the chip, but I'm amazed signed carry is not 
present..
<GARY-S> it was even available on the 8-bit general uP's
