bit occurs
<[Robert] R.BERKEY> at the transition between -1 and 0.
<JAX> is here.
<GARY-S> I understand carry
<[Robert] R.BERKEY> For some reason I keep running into it--over and over.
<[Robert] R.BERKEY> BASE LOOP /
<[Robert] R.BERKEY> And it's not in the Intel 80x8x family.
<[Robert] R.BERKEY> Which is why +LOOP implementations use the overflow bit.
